---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import TravelCTA from "../components/TravelCTA.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Hair Transplant in India | CareBridge Health"
  description="Affordable, high-quality hair transplant surgery in India with CareBridge Health. International patient coordination, JCI-accredited partner hospitals, and end-to-end travel support."
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-5 py-12 max-w-5xl space-y-16">

    <!-- PAGE TITLE -->
    <header class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-blue-600 uppercase">
        Hair Transplant for International Patients
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900">
        Restore your hair with safe, modern transplant surgery in India
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl">
        CareBridge Health coordinates hair transplant treatment for international patients
        with carefully selected surgeons and hospitals in India. We focus on safety,
        transparent pricing, and smooth travel – so you can focus on results, not logistics.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- NEW SECTION a: Why patients choose India for hair transplant -->
    <section class="mt-16 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">
        Why many patients choose India for hair transplant
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        India has become a major hub for hair transplant surgery – not because it is
        “cheap”, but because experienced surgeons, high case volumes and lower
        operating costs mean you can access strong medical outcomes at a much lower
        price than in the US, UK or Gulf.
      </p>
      <ul class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-slate-600">
        <li class="bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Up to 70% cost saving</h3>
          <p>Lower hospital and staffing costs, without reducing clinical quality.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">High surgeon experience</h3>
          <p>Many doctors perform hundreds of graft procedures every year.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">English-speaking care</h3>
          <p>Most medical staff communicate comfortably in English.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- NEW SECTION b: What’s included when you book through CareBridge -->
    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">
        What’s included when you book through CareBridge Health
      </h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 text-slate-600">
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>✔ Pre-assessment by partner surgeon from your photos and history.</li>
          <li>✔ Transparent quote with graft count and technique (FUE / DHI, etc.).</li>
          <li>✔ Airport pick-up and drop-off in India.</li>
          <li>✔ Local coordinator support in your language where possible.</li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>✔ Hospital admission and day-of-surgery assistance.</li>
          <li>✔ Basic medicines and post-op care instructions.</li>
          <li>✔ Follow-up check via WhatsApp / video after you return home.</li>
          <li>✔ Help with hotel suggestions near the hospital (you pay hotel directly).</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- NEW SECTION c: Is this right for you? -->
    <section class="mt-16 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-8 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">
        Is a hair transplant with CareBridge right for you?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        We are a good fit if you:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-700 space-y-1">
        <li>Are between 22–60 years old with stable or slowly progressing hair loss.</li>
        <li>Understand that transplant improves density but does not “freeze” hair loss.</li>
        <li>Are willing to follow medical advice about medicines and after-care.</li>
        <li>Want transparent pricing and honest expectations – not miracle promises.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-slate-700 mt-4">
        If that sounds like you, send us your photos on WhatsApp and write “Hair
        assessment”. We’ll reply with a free, no-obligation opinion.
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/919080553616?text=Hi%2C%20I%20want%20a%20hair%20transplant%20assessment"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="inline-flex mt-4 items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition"
      >
        Start WhatsApp assessment
      </a>
    </section>

    <!-- ORIGINAL SECTIONS (kept unchanged) -->
    <!-- WHY CAREBRIDGE / INDIA -->
    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">Why India with CareBridge?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          India offers internationally trained surgeons, advanced techniques and lower costs.
          CareBridge acts as your coordination partner – we are not a hospital, but a bridge
          between you and trusted healthcare providers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-1">Specialist surgeons</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
          We work only with hair-restoration surgeons who regularly treat international
          patients and follow strict safety and hygiene protocols.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-1">Transparent, lower costs</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
          Typical packages can be <span class="font-semibold">50–70% cheaper</span> than
          in the US, UK or GCC, while still using modern FUE/DHI techniques.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-1">End-to-end coordination</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
          From medical reports and video consultation to airport pick-up, hotel booking
          and follow-up, our team helps you at each step.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- COST & PACKAGE OVERVIEW -->
    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">What does a typical package look like?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Final cost depends on grafts required, technique, surgeon and city. However,
          most international patients fall into this range:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-700">
          <li><span class="font-semibold">2,500 – 4,000 grafts</span> FUE / DHI hair transplant</li>
          <li>Pre-operative blood tests and basic investigations</li>
          <li>1–2 days hospital / procedure stay</li>
          <li>3–5 nights hotel accommodation (depending on city)</li>
          <li>Airport pick-up &amp; drop, local transfers for hospital visits</li>
          <li>Medications and initial post-procedure care kit</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          <span class="font-semibold">Note:</span> Packages are for guidance only and
          are not a final quote. Exact cost is confirmed by the treating hospital
          after reviewing your photos and medical history.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 space-y-3">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg">Indicative price range</h3>
        <p class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-700">USD 1,200 – 2,400*</p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">
          *Approximate range for most cases. Currency conversion and exact quote will
          depend on grafts required, surgeon, hospital and city.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700">
          Share your photos and medical details with us on WhatsApp to receive a
          personalised estimate from a partner hospital.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/919080553616"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center mt-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-700"
        >
          Send photos on WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PATIENT JOURNEY -->
    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Your treatment journey with CareBridge</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase mb-1">Step 1</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Initial assessment</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            You share scalp photos, medical history and expectations via WhatsApp or our
            enquiry form. We discuss if you are a likely candidate.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase mb-1">Step 2</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Hospital &amp; cost options</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            We coordinate with partner hospitals to obtain a preliminary treatment
            plan, estimated grafts and cost range tailored to you.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase mb-1">Step 3</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Travel &amp; booking</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            Once you choose an option, we help with appointment dates, travel and stay
            planning. You arrive in India 1 day before the procedure.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase mb-1">Step 4</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Surgery day</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            Detailed consultation with the surgeon, hairline design, and transplant
            using FUE or DHI technique as decided. You usually go back to your hotel
            the same day.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase mb-1">Step 5</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Early recovery</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            Post-op check-up, dressing change, and instructions for washing, sleeping
            and medicines. Most patients are comfortable to travel in 3–5 days.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-600 uppercase mb-1">Step 6</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Follow-up from home</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">
            You share photos at 1, 3, 6 and 12 months. We coordinate with the hospital
            for any queries about shedding phase, regrowth and maintenance.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TECHNIQUES & CANDIDATES -->
    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Techniques we coordinate</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-700">
          <li>
            <span class="font-semibold">FUE (Follicular Unit Extraction):</span>
            minimally invasive technique where individual grafts are extracted and implanted.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="font-semibold">DHI (Direct Hair Implantation):</span>
            a variation of FUE using implanter pens; suitable for selected cases.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="font-semibold">Beard / moustache / eyebrow transplant</span>
            for patients who need facial hair restoration.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          Final choice of technique is made by the treating surgeon after examining your
          donor area, hair characteristics and medical profile.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Who is a good candidate?</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-700">
          <li>Male or female pattern baldness with adequate donor hair</li>
          <li>Age typically above 23–24 years</li>
          <li>Stable or medically controlled hair fall</li>
          <li>No severe uncontrolled medical conditions</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
          Patients with very weak donor area, active uncontrolled hair fall, or unrealistic
          expectations may not be suitable for transplant and may be advised alternative
          treatments instead.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- RISKS & HONEST EXPECTATIONS -->
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Results, timelines & risks – realistic view</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        New hair growth after transplant is a slow process. Initial shedding is expected,
        and full visible results can take <span class="font-semibold">9–12 months</span>.
        No genuine doctor can guarantee a specific density or “perfect” result.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-700">
        <li>Shedding of transplanted hair in first 1–2 months (normal)</li>
        <li>Regrowth typically starts around 3–4 months</li>
        <li>Most improvement visible between 6–12 months</li>
        <li>Possible side-effects: swelling, discomfort, temporary numbness, infection (rare)</li>
        <li>Smoking, diabetes, scalp health and after-care strongly influence outcome</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
        We encourage you to ask questions and understand limitations clearly during your
        consultation. Honest expectations lead to happier patients.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- VIDEO SECTION (PLACEHOLDER FOR SORA/YOUTUBE) -->
    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Watch: How the CareBridge hair transplant journey works</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600">
        This short video explains the full process – from first WhatsApp message to
        flying back home after surgery. You can replace this with a Sora-generated
        explainer or a real clinic video.
      </p>
      <div class="aspect-video w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-black/5 border border-slate-200">
        <!-- Replace the iframe src with your real YouTube / video URL -->
        <iframe
          class="w-full h-full"
          src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID_HERE"
          title="Hair transplant journey with CareBridge Health"
          loading="lazy"
          allowfullscreen
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">
        If you use AI-generated video (Sora), treat it as an illustration of the process,
        not as real patient footage.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- NEW SECTION d: FAQ block (replaces original FAQ) -->
    <section class="mt-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">
        Frequently asked questions
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-700">
        <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer">
            How many days do I need to stay in India?
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Most patients need 3–5 days in total. Day 1: arrival and consultation.
            Day 2: surgery. Day 3–4: first wash and review. Some cases may require
            longer; we’ll tell you in advance.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer">
            How much will it cost?
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-2">
            Pricing depends mainly on graft count and technique. After reviewing
            your photos, we share a clear range so you know the budget before
            booking flights. No surprise “add-ons” at the last minute.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details class="bg-slate-50 rounded-lg p-4">
          <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer">
            Do you guarantee results?
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-2">
            No genuine medical provider can guarantee a specific result. What we
            offer is realistic planning, experienced surgeons and proper follow-up
            so your chance of a good outcome is maximised.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TRAVEL CTA (Makemytrip / Skyscanner block) -->
    <TravelCTA />

  </main>
</Layout>
</DOCUMENT>